nt cast of unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s the seemingly respectable yet suspicious Captain Theodore; Axel, the sharp\u2011tongued son of the uncompromising Griff of the Citou family\u2014and Griff himself, even more unyielding than his son.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The defiant rebel Rafe Fang, always fighting against something; the lively girl with a camera; the elegant and dignified Madame Ruan; a mysterious woman rumored to wield magic; a warm\u2011hearted, talkative old fishmonger; and a foul\u2011mouthed, troublemaking brat who always stirs up chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge connections with these diverse inhabitants and uncover the hidden stories they each carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter, no matter how small, will bring you closer to discovering the city\u2019s true face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660230/extras/ad1a5d5cdf23914438b73cdd33397be6.poster.avif?t=1753957722\" width=1600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660230/extras/ad1a5d5cdf23914438b73cdd33397be6.webm?t=1753957722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660230/extras/e341fc7992dc0fbab0c4b53c46b26459.poster.avif?t=1753957722\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660230/extras/e341fc7992dc0fbab0c4b53c46b26459.webm?t=1753957722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Shadow&quot;, a strange creature attached to you that reads memories and reconstructs the traces of the deceased!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Don't worry, Lucas, we're just using each other. You use me to find the culprit, and I, well, I love tasting those bizarre stories, hahaha!&quot;, says the Shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In an alternate post-war divided city, players take on the role of Detective Lucas. Use your eloquence, intelligence, the ability to rewind time (or even violence) to investigate and deduce various bizarre cases, unraveling a shocking secret behind them. Justice or love? The decision is yours.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean",
    "reviews": "\u201cKill the Shadow was one of my favourite demos of Next Fest, and I highly recommend checking it out.\u201d<br>TheGamer<br>",
